{"2813430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Money Block", "steam_appid": 2813430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5043120], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE CRYPTO KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the blockchain, manipulate the markets, and ruin your rivals in this crypto board game where greed shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WOLF OF THE BLOCKCHAIN, THAT'S YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the ruthless arena of digital finance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money Block blends the tension of an economic strategy game with the fun of a board game night with friends. Your goal: buy low, sell high, mine relentlessly, and stack more wealth than your rivals before time runs out. Here, fortune changes hands every turn, and sometimes it never comes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR CARDS, CREATE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b2481caadf50e2e58e735011e678f7b7.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b2481caadf50e2e58e735011e678f7b7.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b2481caadf50e2e58e735011e678f7b7.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market isn't just about luck. Use your hand to bend the economy to your will, or sabotage your rivals directly.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Cards</strong>: drawn automatically, they trigger global events (regulations, hacks, celebrity tweets) that shake up prices for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Cards</strong>: your personal arsenal. Launch a cyberattack on a rival's rigs, trigger an artificial &quot;Pump &amp; Dump,&quot; or shield your assets from an incoming crash.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIRE UP THE RIGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/2fb7db887ebbfb12d897c4d2b567e962.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/2fb7db887ebbfb12d897c4d2b567e962.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/2fb7db887ebbfb12d897c4d2b567e962.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just speculate: become a real player in the network. Manage your CPU power and energy consumption to validate blocks. Every secured block earns you fixed rewards and tightens your grip on the game's economy. Manage up to 6 different cryptocurrencies: diversification is often what separates the trader who survives from the one who panic-sells everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO, PLAY WITH FRIENDS, RUIN EVERYONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf of finance or a regular at game night, Money Block adapts to how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode (vs AI)</strong>: no players online? No problem. Jump into a game instantly against one or several AI opponents who won't cut you any slack. Perfect for learning the mechanics, testing new card combos, or fine-tuning your mining strategy at your own pace, before taking it to real players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer (2 to 6 players)</strong>: create or join a lobby to face real players. Bluffing, negotiation, and Action Cards: whatever it takes to wreck your friends' portfolios (or future ex-friends') in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AT A GLANCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crypto/economic board game, up to 6 players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New: instant solo mode against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portfolio management with up to 6 cryptocurrencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining system (CPU/Energy) with rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market Cards (random events) and Action Cards (sabotage/protection)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bluffing, negotiation, and sabotage between players</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE CRYPTO KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the blockchain, manipulate the markets, and ruin your rivals in this crypto board game where greed shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WOLF OF THE BLOCKCHAIN, THAT'S YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b7b9b8e7794e1ca65706e70e8b6a5bdd.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the ruthless arena of digital finance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money Block blends the tension of an economic strategy game with the fun of a board game night with friends. Your goal: buy low, sell high, mine relentlessly, and stack more wealth than your rivals before time runs out. Here, fortune changes hands every turn, and sometimes it never comes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR CARDS, CREATE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b2481caadf50e2e58e735