y. Manage up to 6 different cryptocurrencies: diversification is often what separates the trader who survives from the one who panic-sells everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO, PLAY WITH FRIENDS, RUIN EVERYONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.poster.avif?t=1786984191\" width=678 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.webm?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813430/extras/b65ed36056a3ee69def1edda08147d81.mp4?t=1786984191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf of finance or a regular at game night, Money Block adapts to how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode (vs AI)</strong>: no players online? No problem. Jump into a game instantly against one or several AI opponents who won't cut you any slack. Perfect for learning the mechanics, testing new card combos, or fine-tuning your mining strategy at your own pace, before taking it to real players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer (2 to 6 players)</strong>: create or join a lobby to face real players. Bluffing, negotiation, and Action Cards: whatever it takes to wreck your friends' portfolios (or future ex-friends') in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AT A GLANCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crypto/economic board game, up to 6 players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New: instant solo mode against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portf